schway-screen 1
screen approval-command
title Approve a command
description A mutating command waits for an interactive approval choice.
variant light-50
size 50x30
cursor 1 1 hidden
== text
 ⚡ schway  ~/demo

  Allow bash? · ask mode

  bun test --filter clamp


















  › Allow once
    Allow bash for this session
    Deny with reason…

 ◌ Approval required · Ctrl+C cancel turn
 ◆ Ask  ◌ Approval   script…    Esc deny  ctx ~16
 ↑↓ choose · Enter allow once · Esc deny
